# Excluded from synthesis only.
#
# The clock gates: synthesis inserts exactly one ICG type, named by
# SYNTH_CLOCKGATE_POSEDGE_ICG, and nothing else may reach the netlist.
# DFFMRQX2: scan flop, no scan chain in this design.
#
# DFFRQ2X*/DFFRQ4X* were excluded 2026-09-10 to 2026-09-14 for a broken
# Verilog view (every Q simulated as x). The September 2026 drop fixed it, see
# doc/sclqa_report.md.
#
# LibreLane's process_list_file takes '#' comments and blank lines.
CGX1
CGX2
